### APISIX Admin API examples
### Run these after services exist. Admin API: http://localhost:9180

PUT http://localhost:9180/apisix/admin/routes/hotel-service
X-API-KEY: {{APISIX_ADMIN_KEY}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uri": "/api/hotels/*",
  "upstream": {
    "type": "roundrobin",
    "nodes": {
      "hotel-service:8000": 1
    }
  }
}

